sde (0.2.0~alpha3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Xanara: direct editing of PDF text and pictures (Edit mode), saved as
    incremental updates with embedded font subsets; page operations,
    merging, encryption, redaction, printing (libcups) and OCR
    (libtesseract) in-process through libqpdf and poppler; no external
    programs (qpdf, ghostscript, pdftoppm, lp, tesseract) any more.
  * Merkadu: background refresh of the software lists at start, catalog
    diagnosis instead of empty pages, the DEP-11 icon archives enabled
    (/etc/apt/apt.conf.d/60merkadu), All Software through libapt-pkg with
    marked changes, Home with highlights and recommendations, Flathub
    added by the postinst, Enable Snap Support, uninstall protection for
    essential packages; Software Updater updates the system only.
  * Session: Flatpak export directories and the snap launchers in
    XDG_DATA_DIRS, /snap/bin in PATH.
  * Start Menu: favorites again, tile folders, live badges (notifications
    and com.canonical.Unity.LauncherEntry) on tiles, list, search and the
    taskbar.
  * Safe copying: copies to removable, external and network drives count
    what the drive has taken and finish after syncfs; new transfer dialog
    with an animated penguin in Liria and on the desktop.
  * Liria: hover repaints only what changes; network places in the
    location bar with its own sign-in dialog.
  * Niny: tab close buttons, inactive for the only tab; full menu bar.
  * Photo collages; Gallery Edit With; plugins for Photo and Gallery.
  * New programs: debrun (with debrun-helper) and sde-appimage.
  * Control Center: account renames applied at boot by
    sde-account-rename.service.
  * sde-desktop recommends gnome-keyring and libpam-gnome-keyring,
    suggests wsdd.

