    windows, Control Center > About, Welcome and the session entry; a new
    icon family for every SDE application, shown in title bars and on
    taskbar buttons too.
  * About windows: About, Credits, License (full text, open-source licenses)
    and Legal sections from data/legal/components.json; GNU --version.
  * SDE Settings renamed Control Center (sde-control-center command): an
    overview with search and categories; Users & Avatar, Start Menu and
    Date & Time pages.
  * User pictures from the Start Menu account button or the Control Center
    (~/.face and AccountsService); sample pictures in /usr/share/Avatar.
  * Start Menu on an application catalog: about 4 ms to open, 2 ms per
    keystroke, smooth scrolling, Super commands no longer lost, keyboard
    navigation, App info and Open file location.
  * Liria: translucent rubber-band selection in every SDE theme.
  * Release audit (docs/AUDIT-0.2.0-alpha1.md, docs/SECURITY.md):
    debion-network-check --apt-proxy only takes a single-line URL and its
    pkexec action only the desktop modes; panel, notification, Gallery and
    Xanara memory-safety fixes; no plain-HTTP fallbacks; SDE WM crash fixes
    and release build.
  * Desktop and panel set their window type before the first map
    (SDE-FLTK 1.3.11-sde3), so they stay visible when the window manager
    starts at the same moment.
  * sde-desktop recommends debion-desktop-base instead of depending on it;
    AppStream metadata is CC0-1.0 in debian/copyright.
  * tools/showcase.py: screenshots of every component, attached to every CI
    build as sde-screenshots_<version>.zip.

