sde (0.1.0~alpha13) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the panel crash ("panel keeps stopping", SIGSEGV ~5 s after login):
    a D-Bus call that timed out (org.bluez on machines without Bluetooth)
    freed its timeout while SDE re-armed it. Watches are guarded the same
    way. Regression test added.
  * sde-session restarts a panel that keeps crashing in safe mode; SDE
    programs write a backtrace to session.log when they crash.
  * New tray icons that show the real state (Wi-Fi strength, wired,
    offline, volume, battery and charging, Bluetooth connected, keyboard
    layout, Do Not Disturb); USB drive, Bluetooth, media and battery icons
    appear only while that hardware or source exists (udev hotplug).
  * The Action Center has its own button in the panel corner; the clock
    opens the calendar.
  * Own ecosystem: the SDE toolkit (FLTK 1.3.11, static), sde-xsettingsd
    and sde-polkit-agent are built from pinned sources like SDE WM and the
    SDE compositor; no distribution FLTK, xsettingsd or polkit agent needed.

